flowchart TD
  A[Extract source snapshots] --> B[Land encrypted raw files]
  B --> C[Validate schema and checksums]
  C -->|Pass| D[Normalize dates and IDs]
  C -->|Fail| Q[Quarantine and alert]
  D --> E[Reference lookups and exact matching]
  E --> F[MDM crosswalk]
  F --> G[Load dimensions first]
  G --> H[Load fact rows idempotently]
  H --> I[Reconcile counts and integrity]
  I -->|All gates pass| J[Publish warehouse partition]
  I -->|Any gate fails| Q
  Q --> K[Owner triage and replay]
